## 📊 Summary of Core Attack Focus Areas

| Attack Category | Common Example | What It Targets | Primary Impact |
|---|---|---|---|
| Client-Side | XSS / CSTI | Website Visitors | Session Theft / Keylogging |
| Database Layer | SQL Injection | Database Engines | Data Leakage / Modification |
| Operating System | RCE / Command Injection | Server Hardware | Full System Compromise |
| Access Control | IDOR | Application Logic | Unauthorized Data Access |
| Server Trust | SSRF | Internal Networks | Cloud Data Leakage |

